t("Bites the target for %d%% weapon damage, potentially causing it to bleed for %d%% weapon damage over five turns.\n\t\tIf the target is affected by the bleed it will send the devourer into a frenzy for %d turns (which in turn will frenzy other nearby devourers).\n\t\tThe frenzy will increase global speed by %d%%, physical crit chance by %d%%, and prevent death until -%d%% life.", "Bites the target for %d %% weapon damage, potentially causing it to bleed for %d %% weapon damage over five turn.\nSi el objetivo se ve afectado por la hemorragia enviará el devourer a un frenesí para los turnos de %d (que a tu vez frenesí otros devoradores cercanos).\nEl frenesí aumentará la velocidad global por %d %%, riesgo físico de crit por %d %%, y prevenir la muerte hasta -%d %% vida.", "tformat")
t("Summon a storm of swirling blades to slice your foes, inflicting %d physical damage and bleeding to anyone who approaches for %d turns.\n\t\tThe damage and duration will increase with your Mindpower.", "Invocar una tormenta de cuchillas giratorias para cortar tus enemigos, infligir daño físico a %d y sangrar a cualquiera que se acerque para turnos de %d.\nEl daño y la duración aumentarán con tu poder mental.", "tformat")
